(THE SMALL COFFEE BREWING GUIDE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Good coffee is mostly about three things: fresh beans, the right grind,) Tj
T*
(and the ratio of coffee to water. This guide keeps it simple and covers) Tj
T*
(two easy brewing methods you can do at home without fancy machines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(THE GOLDEN RATIO) Tj
T*
(A reliable starting point is 60 grams of coffee per litre of water, which) Tj
T*
(is about two tablespoons of ground coffee per cup. Adjust to taste: more) Tj
T*
(coffee for a stronger cup, less for a milder one.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
