(THE FRENCH PRESS) Tj
T*
(Grind the beans coarse, like sea salt. Add the grounds and pour water) Tj
T*
(just off the boil, around 95 degrees Celsius. Stir once, put the lid on,) Tj
T*
(and wait four minutes. Then press the plunger down slowly and serve) Tj
T*
(straight away so it does not turn bitter.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(THE POUR-OVER) Tj
T*
(Use a medium grind and a paper filter. Pour a little water first to wet) Tj
T*
(the grounds and let them bloom for 30 seconds, then pour the rest in slow) Tj
T*
(circles. The whole brew should take about three minutes.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
